# Local gate and tool scratch. `t.err` was committed by accident: a fuzz command's
# stderr was redirected to it and the file was added wholesale. tools/docgate now
# rejects any tracked file in the repository root that is not one of the eleven
# that belong there, so the class cannot recur silently -- but the patterns below
# are the first line of defence, because a file that is never staged is never
# tracked. See `.github/workflows/ci.yml` and tools/docgate.
*.err
*.out
*.log
*.prof
*.orig
*.rej
*.bak

# Dashboard acceptance harness (dev-only tooling; package-lock.json is
# committed, node_modules is not)
tools/uxtest/node_modules/

# Generated by TestExportRejectionPages when TANTU_EXPORT_REJECTION_PAGES is set.
# Reviewers write it, then open it; it is a local artefact, not source.
/rejection-pages.html
